{"title": "Support: Myth or Fact", "type": "Myth or fact", "hooks": ["Three things you believe about support. Only one is true.", "Myth or fact? Three chart beliefs, and you probably trust the third.", "You trust support to hold. Three beliefs, one real chart."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three things you believe about support. Only one is true.", "text": "Only one is true", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "One bounce proves it? Myth.", "vo": "One: a single bounce proves support will hold. Myth. One candle is never a guarantee, only a clue.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Volume into the level? Fact.", "vo": "Two: when volume grows into a level, a break is likelier. Fact. When volume dries up, the level is more likely to hold.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Back at support", "vo": "Three: strong support doesn't need a stop. Here's the price, back at support. Hold or break?", "cues": [{"say": "back at support", "do": "zoom", "from": 50, "to": 90}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Myth: it broke", "vo": "It broke. The price closed through and stayed through. Twenty-five candles later, it was down 5 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 81, "label": "Sw", "side": "high"}], "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Every trade needs a stop", "vo": "Levels hold often enough to trade, and break often enough that every trade needs a stop.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Which one fooled you?", "vo": "Comment which one fooled you, and practise on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three things you believe about support. Only one is true.\n\nOne bounce proves support will hold: myth.\nVolume growing into a level makes a break likelier: fact.\nStrong support doesn't need a stop: myth. This one broke and fell 5% in 25 candles.\n\nComment which one fooled you.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictio